<h1>Elizabeth &quot;Beth&quot; Rochford</h1>
<p>17th Police District Council, on the Chicago ballot February 23, 2027. Incumbent.</p>
<h2>Running on</h2>
<p>Filed nominating petitions on Oct. 19, 2026 for reelection. Running on a slate, &quot;The Team for 17,&quot; with Lisa Levy and Paddy Lindley. The slate&#39;s fundraising page says its focus is police accountability, public safety, and alternative response programs, holding space for residents to discuss policing, and keeping the council&#39;s work transparent and accessible.</p>
<h2>Background</h2>
<p>17th District Council member since 2023 and its nominating committee member; gerontological nurse practitioner and lifelong 17th District resident; founding member of ONE Northside&#39;s Police Accountability Task Force and worked to pass the ordinance that created the Commission and the District Councils.</p>
